# 766. Toeplitz Matrix

## Solution 1 (time O(mn), space O(1))

```python
class Solution(object):
    def isToeplitzMatrix(self, matrix):
        """
        :type matrix: List[List[int]]
        :rtype: bool
        """
        m, n = len(matrix), len(matrix[0])
        for i in range(1, m):
            for j in range(1, n):
                if matrix[i][j] != matrix[i - 1][j - 1]:
                    return False
        return True
```
